ys  and men are subjected to an onslaught of  images and messages about what's healthy  and how to be fit and what's the perfect  body  and that is having an impact Nita claims  of the 30 million who suffer from a  variety of eating disorders 10 million  are men 10 million men I truly think  that those numbers are off higher and I  would say I don't think I know that  Marge OMA is now helping others to  recover he's become an ambassador for  Nita speaking out and raising awareness  how awesome is it now that I get to  voluntarily walk away from something  that I love so much to do something that  I'm passionate about too  I want to be someone that people look at  you mean they go or they look on my  tombstone they go this guy just wanted  to make a difference he just when he was  there he just loved life for CBS this  morning  Jamie yuccas kai yuccas California Bravo  to him for speaking out that way those  guys don't do that it's gonna help a lot  of people today
 

